WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.740
Your WordPress site is down.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.893
Customers hit an error page, and leave.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:12.679
At LetsFixWP, we have one goal: getting broken WordPress sites back online.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.704
Tell us what you're seeing. Our engineers find what's wrong.

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.230
You get a fixed price before any work starts.

6
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.821
We work through a login you create. Never your password.

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.319
Before any change, we back up your whole site.

8
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.746
Then the team fixes it, one step at a time.

9
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.236
When we are done, our access is removed.

10
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.894
Your site is back online. Today.

11
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.146
LetsFixWP.
